  unitName: Holy Shock Emilia
  unitId: 40125
  unitNumber: 444
  description: A female general reportedly from the Atharva Republic. She was saved
    by Eze after finding herself in trouble fighting the gods. Afterwards, she became
    obsessed with power, and, inheriting equipment from a former ally procured from
    the otherworld, poured all she had into strengthening herself. In the end there
    would be rumors of her relationships with Weiss, Eze, former allies and so forth,
    despite her being recorded as saying, "It's pathetic only being able to see human
    relationships from an emotional standpoint."
  summonDesc: Are you searching for <br>power just as I am?<br>I will follow your
    will then!
  fusionDesc: This is a Summoner's power?<br>I accept your offering!<br>I will use
    it to grow stronger!
  evoDesc: I desire the greatest of power!<br>Summoner, what do you need<br>from
    my evolved form?
